**B2 — parallelise the seven non-sweep top-level tests.** Add `t.Parallel()` to:

| Test | File | Note |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `TestStableHybridActivationCommitsWithoutRestarting` | `activation_test.go` | own `newEnv` |
